ind":"announcement","title":"Steam Next Fest is live! Play the free SHARDS demo","summary":"Steam Next Fest has begun! SHARDS is taking part in Steam Next Fest. While the festival runs, you can play the free demo right from this page. Bring a partner and try to get the indescribable across to each other. Runs until October 26, 10:00 AM Pacific Time (PDT) What's in the demo The first 3 sectors Free Play (Lv1–2) Descent (Roguelite) — up to the first boss Sectors are online co-op, so have voice chat ready. Free Play can also be played solo, and Descent is a solo mode (one person takes bot","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:02:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691508","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:04:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4871080-1836506165559489","game_id":"steam-4871080","kind":"update","title":"SHARDS Demo — big update: now much easier to learn","summary":"The SHARDS demo just got a big update — it's much easier to learn. Huge thanks to everyone (and the streamers!) who played the demo and shared feedback. The #1 thing we heard was \"it takes a while to click.\" So we rebuilt onboarding. What's new See the correct answer when you slip up. Get a puzzle wrong and the demo now highlights the right button for the Operator and the exact rule/cell the Guide should read — wrong options dim out, so the \"aha\" is instant. In the tutorial and First-Timer Co-op","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-29T07:46:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165559489","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:04:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4871080-1836506165557318","game_id":"steam-4871080","kind":"announcement","title":"The SHARDS Demo is out now — play it free!","summary":"The SHARDS Demo is out now — free. You can finally play SHARDS. Grab the demo from this page, bring a friend, and see if you can describe the indescribable. What's in the demo The free demo includes the first 3 sectors plus Free Play (Lv1–2). The full game adds all 20 sectors, every difficulty, extra modes (Stage Mode and the \"Descent\" roguelite), online co-op for up to 4 with extra roles (Suppressor, Decoder), and more. How it plays SHARDS is a no-language, asymmetric co-op horror puzzle for 2 ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-27T22:21:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165557318","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:04:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4871080-1835871199314646","game_id":"steam-4871080","kind":"announcement","title":"SHARDS is now on Steam — Wishlist now!","summary":"Describe the indescribable. The SHARDS Steam page is live — and you can wishlist it right now. We're a small studio, LUMICROFT, and this is the game we've been quietly building. Thanks for being here early. What is SHARDS? A no-language, asymmetric co-op horror puzzle for 2–4 players (best as a duo). You and your partner look at different screens and can never see each other's — only your voices connect you. Voice-only, asymmetric co-op — separate screens, different information. Nameless symbols","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-23T05:46:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199314646","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:04:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4871080":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:48:35Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T04:48:34Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4871080":"2026-10-26T04:48:35Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4871080":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:48:34Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T04:48:34Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4886530":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:48:35Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T04:48:35Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4871080","app_id":4871080,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:03Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"b2a829d0e37d75f0123b7d9e1c48907cdfa3a92559a3c276f2fce413f955dc8f","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"SHARDS는 2~4인 비대칭 협력 퍼즐로, 2인이 가장 좋습니다. 한 명은 보드를 조작하고, 나머지는 규칙만 압니다. 서로의 화면은 볼 수 없고, 오직 목소리만이 둘을 잇습니다. 그러나 전달해야 할 것은 이름 없는, 말로 설명하기 힘든 기호들. 중앙의 '우리 속 핵'이 고동치고, 실수할 때마다 더 붉게 부풀어 붕괴에 가까워집니다. 의사소통 실패는 곧 죽음 — 오직 목소리로 붕괴를 막으세요.","publishers":[{"name":"LUMICROFT"}],"developers":[{"name":"LUMICROFT"}]},"release":{"is_coming_soon":true,"custom_release_date_message":"출시 예정","coming_soon_display":"text_comingsoon"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Trailer韓国語","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1782190781","trailer_category":3,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"4871080/802763374/cbde4ca0a2f0fb32a7a9044da94dfb07ac9fc984/1781964467/microtrailer.webm","type":"video/webm"},{"filename":"4871080/802763374/cbde4ca0a2f0fb32a7a9044da94dfb07ac9fc984/1781964467/microtrailer.mp4","type":"video/mp4"}],"adaptive_trailers":[{"cdn_path":"4871080/802763374/cbde4ca0a2f0fb32a7a9044da94dfb07ac9fc984/1781964467/dash_av1.mpd","encoding":"dash_av1"},{"cdn_path":"4871080/802763374/cbde4ca0a2f0fb32a7a9044da94dfb07ac9fc984/1781964467/dash_h264.mpd","encoding":"dash_h264"},{"cdn_path":"4871080/802763374/cbde4ca0a2f0fb32a7a9044da94dfb07ac9fc984/1781964467/hls_264_master.m3u8","encoding":"hls_h